  "notes": "The wallet-backend repository uses this transaction as a replay fixture for nonce-derived participants. Apply index 8 of 14; envelope stage 0, cluster 0, position 6 (a fee bump: GCNJB6V5\u2026 pays 466265 and gets 64116 back, the inner source GBKDL6ZO\u2026 only has its sequence bumped). add_context_rule writes the wallet's own data (policy, context rule, signer and lookup entries) and installs a spending-limit policy in CABXBYJN\u2026, which creates one entry of its own. The nonce 8688256074336626525 is created as temporary contract data of CBBRS7XL\u2026. Testnet is reset on 2026-12-16; the vendored object will then be the only copy."
